    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/1d31e0a45e3ca4e9da278240452dff53.poster.avif?t=1755528749\" width=702 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/1d31e0a45e3ca4e9da278240452dff53.webm?t=1755528749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/1d31e0a45e3ca4e9da278240452dff53.mp4?t=1755528749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0\u00a0</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/30cfa8d4ecfce93ef66e142e23bd4452.avif?t=1755528749\" width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/961b128adf4a7142fd4ddfbded64fde1.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Mali, 1313 Mansa Musa, the 10th ruler of the Mali Empire (r. 1312 to 1337 CE), is widely regarded as one of the wealthiest and most powerful rulers in history. Known for his immense gold wealth, he was also a military leader who expanded Mali\u2019s territory and secured its dominance in West Africa.<br><br> The King, no longer satisfied with his travels in the mortal realm, used his immense wealth to build a portal to the Underworld. He quickly tamed the Treasure Guardians, terrible beasts with supernatural powers. These beasts threaten the delicate balance of the Underworld. Can you dispose of the Treasure Guardians and their Mortal master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/0f7bdb92835c635dfff1eb3978f2c938.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=150 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy Mansa Musa's Treasure Guardians in this brand new arcade time-attack survival shooter. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You have 10 seconds to eat gold or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *Unlock demons with various abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *Boost System: Escape danger by utilizing your boost gauge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Proximity Bonus System: Gain higher bonuses for being closer to enemies on death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *Chain System: Kill enemies and collect gold in quick succession for a score multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *Dual Trigger System: Choose between Offensive and Defensive shots to defend yourself from an army of hungry demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > *Overdrive System: Unleash the rage of Midas on your enemies! Turn demons into gold using your Overdrive. Build your overdrive gauge by destroying enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Steam Leaderboards: Compete against players from around the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/21cb5aa8d46c499604b8947d96c77b7d.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/88093114c4729f74ccb388ceb275d25d.avif?t=1755528749\" width=679 height=480 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/11e14022f8fecf84702d809689f9f9a1.avif?t=1755528749\" width=641 height=481 /></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/93abee4122a2fab31e1f5dd01a267fd8.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/113dc64faeb8335cfd8277ce638388be.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boost System: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape danger by utilizing your boost gauge.<br>[SPACEBAR]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/9404c38349a999ab881dfd68d61e8563.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Proximity Bonus System:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain higher bonuses for being closer to enemies on death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overdrive System:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash the rage of Midas on your enemies! Turn demons into gold using your Overdrive. Build your overdrive gauge by destroying enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Goes off automatically once the meter is full.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/79f7aab766873fce13dce141e9a5a05f.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain System:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill enemies and collect gold in quick succession for a score multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual Trigger System:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose between Offensive and Defensive shots to defend yourself from an army of hungry demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[LEFT_SHIFT]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584590/extras/1eb650f61b3f46ef8328b55dbfe3c386.avif?t=1755528749\" width=600 height=40